<description>&lt;p&gt;Violent clashes continue between Viv Ansanm gangs and Haitian security forces, now reinforced by a Kenya-led multinational mission patrolling Port-au-Prince and Kenscoff. The Dominican army has supplied large ammunition stocks to the 400 Mawozo gang, boosting its firepower against security forces. Erik Prince is operating an anti-gang mercenary effort in Haiti, adding a private-security dimension to the conflict. The United Nations has allocated an additional US$75 million for life-saving aid to 507,000 people. The UCDP recorded 193 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipwFBVV95cUxNZUQwWXpVMHR6Q1AxNFUwMGV5Rnc0XzhzN21LUDVWaUZQTEp3QUdtYVFIRy1FUFdJdXJTejA1V010UlBib004TEtjU1RWeXVNRHhCTmFRdndHQ1lsZzVYZEtZdXBDLUlINDVEbm1kQ2NkR05GTnB3R2toN1VJRFUtRVRFWi1XXy02d1FBRElzak5tYTFnZWJVMDBEVDMyY3ZnMXBSNW90OA?oc=5&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinwFBVV95cUxOeDZ6Wi04MXVDWkQxTmpnZDVSd0xmVXdaOGE5bnhKT1R4eG4yOElxUlJYaVlEdDhmdmM3emhmaFhURFpJZl9iTU5kMFl0c1hQQ0QxWmZmR3dVZWtqaDNBRy14eFl5UmlwdHkwQktDRVdCR0FmVmVXVU1IRUVYcGJyX0oxS3NwZmZ1OFYwTGhWLUZLdkFkZ3dZVW5HR1YxWm8?oc=5&quot;&gt;UA.NEWS&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirAFBVV95cUxQUG83NEJkREJleDlXTV8zcUZYUDFVSTVTaFhZQXZxR2hPMlpnNHpOYlZQVWJzUU10eHloa3pRbG9LOUR4SEFYbzFwQVhHeXU4WnlJY2hObzNVdmdQaXlRUFk3Y2JnMnE0d0lvMzUyS1ROMjVkMnFTVnVtS1JMc2pUQi1Bb0dKMmJIdWRXcGk4eGdLdVJSSnc4S0Q5bWdoWm9nbndMOXFBNHhkSWY1?oc=5&quot;&gt;Anadolu Ajansı&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijwFBVV95cUxNdlpXeGoxRnhXOVAyaWFtNWZSQi1PM3ZxRlhYUDlZaU4zNXIxbjMyYWxwWHFkZFlXMjlvWmM4MFMxaWFMd0dVYnRDdk1LQno4NXdKRWhIZFZydk5lRXRqUnVUbzd3T1VWS3ZDUXJPN1hRbTRfSHJESjkzemU0V1BjbjZ1cVd6bmF2eHdLSkdZTQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;WORLD News Group&lt;/a&